&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Together AI&#39;s Amsterdam office is growing — and so is our hiring across Europe and India. With several active searches underway and interview volume increasing, we&#39;re building out local People support in Amsterdam. That&#39;s where you come in.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a generalist role spanning three areas: recruiting coordination for our Europe and India hiring, HR administration (onboarding, offboarding, benefits, and special projects), and day-to-day office and workplace operations for our growing Amsterdam team and office. You&#39;ll be the first person to hold this combined role in Amsterdam, which means you&#39;ll have real ownership over how the work gets done — building process and structure, not just following someone else&#39;s playbook.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll report to our Talent Operations Partner (based in San Francisco), which means you&#39;ll operate with a high degree of day-to-day autonomy. For the office/workplace side of the role, you&#39;ll also have a dedicated local mentor on our International Finance &amp;amp; Operations team, so you&#39;re never fully on your own. As our Amsterdam office continues to grow, there&#39;s real potential for this role to grow with it.&lt;/p&gt;
