&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Own end-to-end interview scheduling for our Europe and India hiring, working closely with the recruiting team&amp;nbsp; to manage high interview volume across multiple time zones and seniority levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Manage offer letters and support onboarding and offboarding processes, handling sensitive and confidential information with care.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Own daily operations and employee support for our Amsterdam office, including office maintenance and food, beverage &amp;amp; employee events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Support other HR special projects as they come up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Build and improve processes across all three areas — as the first dedicated person in this role, you&#39;ll help define how this work gets done at Together AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Partner closely with our recruiting team, People team, and local Amsterdam colleagues to keep everything running smoothly as the office scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
