&lt;li&gt;Design and ship core features of Together&#39;s Customer Insights platform — the systems customers rely on to see, trace, and act on their own activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the technical design for new capabilities, including proposing architecture, writing design docs, and getting buy-in across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Data Platform and Observability engineering teams to leverage Together’s core data stack and capabilities to build out Customers Insights data collection and stream processing systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own significant areas of the system end-to-end — from design through implementation, testing, rollout, and long-term health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and maintain critical-path backend and product code used by multiple teams and customer-facing surfaces. Identify risks and blockers early, drive resolution across team boundaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
